        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 14.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ðæs eaca sy ús eallum gemæne þe on ðissum iglandum wuniað.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But this addition shall apply generally to all of us who dwell in these islands.</ab>
